    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n896" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">admissum</span></b> , i, n.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				wrong done</i>, <i>a trespass</i>, <i>fault</i>, <i>crime</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">judicia, quae etiam nullo admisso consequi
					possent,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Part. Or. 35</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tale admissum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					25, 23</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">de admissis Poppeae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					11, 4</span></i>
			; cf. admitto, II. C.</div>
